      "en": "When the dew that lay had gone, behold, on the surface of the wilderness was a small round thing, small as the frost on the ground.",
      "ko": "그 이슬이 마른 후에 광야 지면에 작고 둥글며 서리 같이 세미한 것이 있는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "b76b6bde49887db8a5e76aa4b82e8acf6f3d7ffbe8332c7193295dac5ab0f4aa",
      "translation_text_hash": "653d2d65e6ceff515275dffcd5c94932bbeaa4cd677cf74bd89442a9808dae99",
