      "en": "This is the thing which the LORD has commanded: ‘Gather of it everyone according to his eating; an omer a head, according to the number of your persons, you shall take it, every man for those who are in his tent.’”",
      "ko": "여호와께서 이같이 명하시기를 너희 각 사람의 식량대로 이것을 거둘지니 곧 너희 인수대로 매명에 한 오멜씩 취하되 각 사람이 그 장막에 있는 자들을 위하여 취할지니라 하셨느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a78b77973ccc5084f619122c8edcb4a90697de449151a1536d493dec9f21f50e",
      "translation_text_hash": "e3b38c447d111600727bc75611611a7066c74f6531ac40e8b0b2d3bc39b266ad",
