      "en": "Notwithstanding they didn’t listen to Moses, but some of them left of it until the morning, so it bred worms and became foul; and Moses was angry with them.",
      "ko": "그들이 모세의 말을 청종치 아니하고 더러는 아침까지 두었더니 벌레가 생기고 냄새가 난지라 모세가 그들에게 노하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "8d4a6c84c730d3c63877f208215019c4b02a88a622becb50b827f27ed450d44a",
      "translation_text_hash": "7b2c887c989dfea35105f0868468ed7fa8add8061dd3f4064aa79a10d64ab22a",
