      "en": "They gathered it morning by morning, everyone according to his eating. When the sun grew hot, it melted.",
      "ko": "무리가 아침마다 각기 식량대로 거두었고 해가 뜨겁게 쪼이면 그것이 스러졌더라",
      "source_text_hash": "8772d45022ba1d7cd926389a55bb0ae27902a1b8a8981465f315bd0f87be44f8",
