      "en": "On the sixth day, they gathered twice as much bread, two omers for each one; and all the rulers of the congregation came and told Moses.",
      "ko": "제 육일에는 각 사람이 갑절의 식물 곧 하나에 두 오멜씩 거둔지라 회중의 모든 두목이 와서 모세에게 고하매",
      "source_text_hash": "5f6bae4163059aafacccbaf7e87d2e3411675f4694f66690672a81b3bc618d18",
      "translation_text_hash": "010a28a84a3408da12a3f04ff4ec7ab6593ade251eb2c9bb645b1aa3847d7f51",
